00:00:33.940 --> 00:00:35.850
- I like how I'm acting
like, "Oh, you would?"

00:00:35.850 --> 00:00:37.206
Okay. Then, yes."
- [Kelly] Yes, yes.

00:00:37.206 --> 00:00:38.300
